+// For finite float32 scale and an 8-bit code their float64 product is exact
+// (at most 32 significant bits). Let A=|min|+256*scale and V=max |v[i]|.
+// The reconstruction addition and residual subtraction together differ from
+// the real residual by at most 4*u*(V+A), with u=2^-52 (twice unit roundoff).
